# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HigherMindAI redirect map. Duplicated in netlify.toml ON PURPOSE - whichever
# file Netlify resolves first, the rule fires. Do not 'clean up' the
# duplication. Only public/_redirects lands in dist; the copy at the repo
# root is inert and is kept identical so the two can never drift.
#
# ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. Netlify stops at the first match, so every rule
# MUST stay above the /* catch-all at the bottom. 301 with ! (force) so it
# wins even against a matching static file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

